  "details": "While i am working on world with last SDK 3.3.0, i noticed the old bug showed up.\n\n\"World is too big, it's over 100MB size\" but ... i am clearly on PC / Windows mode, so this error message should not happens.\n\nUsually it will fix itself after restart Unity, but it's still a bug. I am kinda surprised the SDK script has not proper check code for it. Sometimes it bugged, especially if you work longer at project, then you will get weird error message your world is too big...\n\nThe bug was also seen in earlier SDKs, even it doesn't happens much, it's kinda stupid error.\n\nWhy can SDK not check properly for it?",
